          "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"34\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">What the Comparison Shows</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Structure vs. surface</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"170\" width=\"260\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#0ea5e9\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"212\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Zeffirelli</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"248\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">period + verse</text><rect x=\"420\" y=\"170\" width=\"260\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"212\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Luhrmann</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"248\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">verse, new setting</text><rect x=\"720\" y=\"170\" width=\"260\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"850\" y=\"212\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\">West Side</text><text x=\"850\" y=\"248\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">no verse at all</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"330\" width=\"600\" height=\"90\" fill=\"#10b981\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"372\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Core conflict survives all three</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"402\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"middle\">love vs. inherited hatred</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"460\" width=\"800\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"510\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Correct: the play's power is largely structural</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"565\" width=\"800\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"610\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Not: verse is indispensable; not all endings survive</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"660\" width=\"800\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"705\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Not: only faithful productions succeed</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"810\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Only West Side Story lets its heroine live</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"910\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Adaptation reveals what is essential to the play</text></svg>",
